sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    participant API as SchemaGeneratorResource
    participant Store as SessionStore
    participant Orch as SchemaGenOrchestrator
    participant JDBC as JDBC Provider
    participant DW as DW
    participant Infer as SchemaInferrer
    participant Enrich as LlmEnricher
    participant Writer as MondrianSchemaWriter
    participant Repo as Repository
    Admin->>API: POST /start/{dataSourceId}
    API->>Store: crear PENDING + sessionId
    API->>Orch: iniciar asíncrono
    API-->>Admin: 202 + sessionId
    Orch->>Store: INTROSPECTING
    Orch->>JDBC: abrir conexión
    JDBC->>DW: DatabaseMetaData
    DW-->>Orch: tablas, columnas, FKs
    Orch->>JDBC: cerrar conexión
    Orch->>Store: INFERRING
    Orch->>Infer: construir DraftSchema
    Infer-->>Orch: borrador
    Orch->>Store: ENRICHING
    Orch->>Enrich: sugerencias opcionales
    Enrich-->>Orch: sugerencias
    Orch->>Store: READY
    Admin->>API: GET status/draft/suggestions
    API->>Store: consultar sesión
    Store-->>Admin: estado y borrador
    Admin->>API: POST ops
    API->>Store: aplicar op y registrar log
    Admin->>API: POST save
    API->>Writer: generar XML + sidecar
    Writer->>Repo: addSchema + saveInternalFile
    API->>Store: SAVED
    API-->>Admin: 204
